{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "不含密码",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 69.86,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，一个犯罪团伙，找上了 Coinbase 的外包客服。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，一个犯罪团伙，找上了 Coinbase 的外包客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 7.448
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "他们没去撬钱包，只是花钱，收买了客服。",
   "spoken": "他们没去撬钱包，只是花钱，收买了客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.9,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 7.9,
   "speechEnd": 11.632
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "被收买的人，从客服工具里，导出了 69461 名用户的数据。",
   "spoken": "被收买的人，从客服工具里，导出了 69461 名用户的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.04,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 12.132,
   "speechEnd": 18.351
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "姓名、联系方式、证件图像、余额、交易记录。",
   "spoken": "姓名、联系方式、证件图像、余额、交易记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 18.82,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 18.82,
   "speechEnd": 23.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "可这份数据里，没有密码，也没有私钥。",
   "spoken": "可这份数据里，没有密码，也没有私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 24.0,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 24.0,
   "speechEnd": 27.192
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "没有钥匙，照理说，打不开任何一个账户。",
   "spoken": "没有钥匙，照理说，打不开任何一个账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 27.58,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 27.676,
   "speechEnd": 32.199
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "可 Coinbase 在提交给 SEC 的文件里估算，这次事件，要花掉约 1.8 亿到 4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "可 Coinbase 在提交给 SEC 的文件里估算，这次事件，要花掉约 1.8 亿到 4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 32.68,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 32.68,
   "speechEnd": 40.775
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "其中一项，是赔偿被冒充客服骗走资金的用户。",
   "spoken": "其中一项，是赔偿被冒充客服骗走资金的用户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 41.22,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 41.22,
   "speechEnd": 45.158
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 45.6,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 45.6,
   "speechEnd": 46.401
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "一天，你接到电话，对方自称交易所客服。",
   "spoken": "一天，你接到电话，对方自称交易所客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 46.86,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 46.958,
   "speechEnd": 51.289
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "他叫得出你的名字，说得出你的余额，还知道你上周提过的工单。",
   "spoken": "他叫得出你的名字，说得出你的余额，还知道你上周提过的工单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 51.72,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 51.812,
   "speechEnd": 56.945
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "他说你的账户有风险，请你把资产，转到一个安全钱包。",
   "spoken": "他说你的账户有风险，请你把资产，转到一个安全钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 57.38,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 57.38,
   "speechEnd": 61.962
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "他是真客服吗？",
   "spoken": "他是真客服吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 62.4,
   "dur": 1.44,
   "speechStart": 62.494,
   "speechEnd": 63.632
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "带着这个问题，我们看看，泄露的数据怎样变成攻击。",
   "spoken": "带着这个问题，我们看看，泄露的数据怎样变成攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
   "start": 64.34,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 64.34,
   "speechEnd": 68.429
  }
